# simsamp.mtb

noecho
note This macro will simulate random sampling of observations,
note keeping track of the number of successes in each sample.
note
note The user is to specify the population proportion,
note the number of samples to be simulated, and the size of each sample.
note
note ***** Do you want to proceed? *****
yesno k1
exec 'simsamp\simsamp1.mtb' k1
echo
end

